package pages

import "nearbyassist/views/layout"

templ PrivacyPolicy() {
	@layout.BasicLayout() {
		<div class="prose max-w-3xl mx-auto p-6 bg-white shadow-lg rounded-lg">
			<h1 class="text-sm font-bold text-neutral-dark mb-4">NearbyAssist Data Privacy Statement</h1>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">NearbyAssist acknowledges the fundamental right to privacy and strives to safeguard its users’ data privacy by adhering to data privacy principles and employing standard safety measures in the collection, processing, disclosure, and retention of personal data in accordance with the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (R.A. 10173), its Implementing Rules and Regulations (IRR), and the issuances of the National Privacy Commission.</p>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">This NearbyAssist Data Privacy Statement (the “NDPS”) provides a detailed approach on how we handle personal data and the steps we take to protect it.</p>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">What Personal Data Does NearbyAssist Collect and Process?</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">NearbyAssist collects and processes only the types and amounts of personal data necessary for Facebook authentication.</p>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">Specifically, the data collected may include:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-dark mb-4">
				<li class="text-xs">Name</li>
				<li class="text-xs">Email address</li>
				<li class="text-xs">Profile picture URL</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">This data is collected solely for the purpose of authenticating your login and ensuring a secure and personalized experience within the app. All data collection is done with your consent, either explicitly or implicitly, after you are informed of the nature and scope of the data being collected for Facebook authentication.</p>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">Why Does NearbyAssist Collect and Process Personal Data?</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">The purpose of collecting and processing personal data within NearbyAssist may vary depending on the specific functionality being provided, such as user authentication, personalized experiences, or app security. However, the underlying principle governing NearbyAssist's data collection process is the legitimacy of purpose.</p>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">NearbyAssist collects and processes data only for legitimate purposes that align with its core functions and comply with applicable legal requirements. These legitimate purposes may include, but are not limited to:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-gray mb-4">
				<li class="text-xs">To verify and identify you as a user of the app.</li>
				<li class="text-xs">To manage your account and personalize your experience.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">How Does NearbyAssist Share or Disclose Personal Data?</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">NearbyAssist takes great care in handling personal data and ensures that it is shared or disclosed only when necessary and with the proper safeguards in place. We will never share or disclose your data to third parties without your prior consent.</p>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">If disclosure is necessary, NearbyAssist ensures that any third-party service providers or external partners involved adhere to strict privacy and security protocols. Additionally, data shared internally within NearbyAssist is subject to a standardized procedure to ensure it is used only for legitimate purposes.</p>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">How Does NearbyAssist Protect Personal Data?</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">We take your privacy seriously. Your data is stored securely in our database and is encrypted to protect your privacy. We implement strict security measures to safeguard your information. However, no system is entirely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute protection.</p>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">How Long Does NearbyAssist Retain Personal Data?</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">NearbyAssist retains personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill its intended purpose or comply with applicable legal and regulatory requirements. The retention period may vary depending on the type of data and its purpose, ranging from days (e.g., session data) to years (e.g., account information). When the data is no longer required, NearbyAssist ensures its proper disposal through secure and confidential means.</p>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">Updates to This NearbyAssist Privacy Policy Statement</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">We may revise this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be communicated through the app or on our website. We encourage you to periodically review this policy for any updates.</p>
		</div>
	}
}
